## 📖 What is this?

**GTA-6-PC-Version-Port-Reverse-Engineering-ai-emulator-gta6** is a reverse-engineering and port documentation repo for getting **GTA 6** running on PC hardware. 

It collects the console build analysis, the RAGE engine file formats, and the AI emulation layer that translates the original instruction and memory model into something a Windows x64 machine can execute — one launch chain instead of a folder of loose tools. Whether you want to unpack the archives, inspect the shader pipeline, or just boot the game and walk around Vice City, this package covers the path.

The layer runs externally and reads the game image from your own legal copy, so the base install is never permanently modified. The package includes a low-latency debug overlay with full instrumentation.

